  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_TYPE_BOX has the value 0</p>
  <p>PRIM_TYPE_BOX is a parameter of <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PRIM_TYPE" target="_blank">PRIM_TYPE</a> used to make prim into a box and to change specific properties that define the shape of that box.</p>
</p>
    </div>

